### List contacts
# @name list-contacts
GET {{crm_url}}/contacts
Accept: application/json
X-Trace: on
Authorization: Bearer {{crm_token}}

### Export contacts
# @name export-contacts
GET {{crm_url}}/contacts/export?format=csv&api_key={{crm_key}}#top

### Find contact
# @name find-contact
GET {{crm_url}}/contacts/search?q=Ada%20Lovelace&owner={{owner_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{crm_token}}
